WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:04,020
This is the mosquito on the old man’s map

2
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:13,190
The Qing Dynasty is not snatching prey

3
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:17,130
He brought one back for me to lead the way.

4
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:24,340
can't wait

5
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:27,920
so late

6
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:31,370
You still have to go into the mountains to find a place instead of venturing into the depths.

7
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:32,770
You say that every time

8
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:41,260
I'll be back before dawn. If your legs are not good, stay and look after Hongxia. Let's go.
